# Agent helper working directory. `ai-bin` writes ai-files/logs/ai-helper-telemetry.log
# into whatever cwd it runs from, so an agent running any ai command from a brewshot
# checkout leaves an untracked file that BLOCKS the next `ai land` on "main worktree is
# dirty". Stafficy ignores this path for the same reason. Observed 2026-08-06: it blocked
# the smoke-linux-evidence land until the file was moved aside.
ai-files/
